{"reference":"Isaiah 62","book":"Isaiah","chapter":62,"status":"pending","sections":[{"kind":"surrounding_passages","title":"Textual Witnesses","blocks":[{"id":"block_1","text":"Isaiah 62 belongs to a book preserved in the Great Isaiah Scroll, an almost complete witness to all sixty-six chapters. It broadly aligns with the Masoretic tradition, though it contains many differences in spelling and content. Other Qumran Isaiah manuscripts and interpretive writings also show that Isaiah was actively copied and interpreted.","provenance_refs":["reader_path_isaiah_062_6b96c52fdb92527a956a4547"],"confidence":"high","interpretation_level":"disputed"}]}],"generated_metadata":null}